# Card hash build intermediates. The packed data/card-hashes.bin IS committed —
# it is what ships so the server never has to fetch 112k images — but the raw
# jsonl it is packed from is a ~15MB build artifact and the log is noise.
data/card-hashes.raw.jsonl
data/card-hashes.normal.jsonl
data/card-hashes.build.log
